RUF079 [*] Use `Generator` instead of `Iterator` for a context manager
  --> RUF079_shadowing.py:8:23
   |
 7 | @contextmanager
 8 | def value_return() -> Iterator[int]:
   |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 9 |     yield 1
10 |     return "done"
   |
help: Replace with `Generator`
   |
1  | from contextlib import asynccontextmanager, contextmanager
   - from typing import AsyncIterator, Iterator
2  + from typing import AsyncIterator, Iterator, Generator
3  + import builtins
4  |
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
8  | @contextmanager
   - def value_return() -> Iterator[int]:
9  + def value_return() -> Generator[int, None, builtins.object]:
10 |     yield 1
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

